Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:13:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] scrrun: TextStream positions and skipping, pipe streams,
 Folder/File/Drive members (3009)

TextStream: Line, Column, AtEndOfLine, Skip, SkipLine and WriteBlankLines.
Streams opened on pipes (WScript.Shell Exec StdOut/StdIn) can now be read:
Read, ReadLine, ReadAll, AtEndOfStream, the end of the stream being the
writer closing the pipe, not a short read.

Folder: Name (rename), ShortPath, ShortName, Drive, ParentFolder, Attributes,
the three dates, Type, Delete, Copy, Move, IsRootFolder and Size (the whole
tree). File: Name, ShortPath, ShortName, Drive, ParentFolder, DateLastAccessed,
Type, Delete, Copy, Move. Drive: Path, ShareName, RootFolder, VolumeName.
FolderCollection Add and Item, DriveCollection Item, FileSystemObject.MoveFolder.

Removes the todo_wine marks that now pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

